      "writtenOn": "2024-03-04T05:06:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Based on John\u0027s suggestion, I\u0027ve removed the \"try, except Exception as e\" blocks around the utils functions.\n\nI believe you meant this thread: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/2971138/comment/9d74dd0a_2c79fbab/\n\nThe situation has changed. We found that raising exceptions is not a good practice because that crashes the Pandora server and fails all later tests. Thus we should catch all of them or just don\u0027t raise.\n\nBTW I noticed a mistype in my previous suggestion. Please `except Exception` rather than `except ValueError`, thanks.",
